{
  "description": "查看或创建工具分类，并在指定分类下创建完整的空白工具项目。自动配齐 .tool 标准配置、Python 入口、依赖声明、测试示例与详细制作资料；模板和资料来自本工具自身 assets。新建工具默认关闭。创建成功后必须先读取返回的 documentation_path，再按文档制作；制作并验证完成后，按用户意愿决定是否修改 state.enabled 开启。创建失败若已返回项目路径，应在该项目修复，避免重复创建。需要前端在线。",
  "execution": {
    "parallel": false
  },
  "files": {
    "examples": ".tool/examples.json",
    "input_schema": ".tool/input.schema.json",
    "output_schema": ".tool/output.schema.json",
    "permissions": ".tool/permissions.json"
  },
  "io": {
    "input": "client_json",
    "output": "client_json"
  },
  "loading": {
    "dynamic": true
  },
  "name": "create_blank_tool",
  "registration_name": "新建空白工具",
  "runtime": {
    "client_capability": {
      "min_version": 1,
      "name": "tool.projects"
    },
    "timeout_seconds": 180,
    "type": "client"
  },
  "state": {
    "enabled": true
  }
}
